<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The shop: the section switcher, the repository browser and the Google Fonts
  list. Only text the user reads is here. Comparison keys, repository topics,
  catalogue category tokens and log messages stay in the data layer on purpose —
  translating one of those would break a comparison without a compile error.

  The one coupling worth naming: `ShopUpdates.NO_RELEASE` is compared against
  the literal `GitHubApi.fail("no suitable release")` produces. Neither side can
  move into a resource.
-->
